{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19988","headline":"寒溪 一 · 孟郊","name":"寒溪 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜洗水色尽，寒溪见纤鳞。\n幸临虚空镜，照此残悴身。\n潜滑不自隐，露底莹更新。\n豁如君子怀，曾是危陷人。\n始明浅俗心，夜结朝已津。\n净漱一掬碧，远消千虑尘。\n始知泥步泉，莫与山源隣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}